WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:01.793
Allie:
Everything's complicated,

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:03.086
Allie:
but there's always a solution.

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:08.133
♪♪

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.179
♪♪

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:13.180
Gotta go.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.932
♪♪

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:15.933
Oh, hi.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:16.934
How was work?

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:18.393
It was good. What're you
reading?

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.686
♪♪

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.687
Oh.

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.856
So you figure out where you're
gonna apply yet?

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:24.066
Don't know.

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:25.859
Josh and I are still talking
about it.

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:29.112
So that's still the plan? Follow
Josh to school?

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.281
Dina:
You and Mom were teenage
sweethearts.

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.283
Dina:
And don't say you had a bond.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.701
Margot!

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.328
You want me to say we had a
bond?

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.746
Yes, I do!

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:39.373
Margot:
We had a bond!

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.167
♪♪

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.460
Allie:
Everything's complicated,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.461
♪♪

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.879
Allie:
but there's always a solution.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:50.259
♪♪

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:51.343
I've seen that car before.

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:52.344
♪♪

00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:53.345
Charlie:
From the bank.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:54.846
Allie:
Those people aren't from the
bank.

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:56.473
♪♪

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:57.474
Hang on.

00:00:57.474 --> 00:01:02.271
♪♪

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:04.648
Allie:
Right now, we need to go.

00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:06.275
Allie:
They found us.

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:08.151
Allie:
We're gonna get somewhere safe.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.903
Allie:
So long, America.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:10.904
Have a nice day.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.072
♪♪

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.282
Dina:
What did he do?

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:14.283
I'm sorry.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.451
♪♪

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:17.452
Shhh.

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:19.538
Pack one bag, be ready in ten
minutes.

00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.622
♪♪

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.207
How much trouble are you
actually in?

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.208
Allie:
Enough.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.501
Dina:
Not everything can be fixed.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:25.502
♪♪

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:26.503
Allie:
Of course it can.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:28.588
The trick is actually wanting to
fix it.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.507
None of us likes this situation.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:33.218
♪♪

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:35.846
Jones:
Unless we do the right thing
here, it will escalate.

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:37.097
♪♪
(Sirens blare)

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.640
♪♪

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.643
What's about to happen might
seem like imperfect parenting.

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:42.644
♪♪

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.687
Allie:
This is gonna be an adventure.

00:01:43.687 --> 00:01:48.108
♪♪

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.068
A bunch of fugitives are headed
south to Mexico.

00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:51.111
♪♪

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.112
Dina:
I had plans.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:54.281
Go to school, get a life.

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:56.366
Dina:
I can't just hide out with you
guys forever.

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:57.743
♪♪

00:01:57.743 --> 00:01:58.744
What're you doing?

00:01:58.744 --> 00:01:59.870
♪♪

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.121
It's difficult to explain.

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:02.331
Hahaha!

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:03.332
♪♪

00:02:03.332 --> 00:02:08.337
I'm interested in you, if you
are who I believe you to be.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.216
I don't think we feel very
comfortable having this
conversation.

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:15.510
♪♪

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.553
Why are you doing this to him?

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:23.143
♪♪

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.978
Why is he doing this to you?

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.147
Jones:
Dina...

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.440
Where are you guys headed?

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:38.283
♪♪

